[
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-01",
    "role": "opening",
    "config": {
      "text": "On the night of December fifth, in towns across the Alps, a shaggy figure with horns, a long red tongue, and rattling chains comes through the streets.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "His name is Krampus.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "He walks beside Saint Nicholas, the kind bishop who brings gifts, and he has come for the children who misbehaved.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "People often say that Krampus is far older than Christmas, an ancient pagan spirit of winter.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-05",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "But what do the oldest records actually show?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P02-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In this episode, we follow Krampus from a bishop's legend, to the devils of old Nicholas customs, to a wave of colorful postcards, and finally to the question of how old he really is.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Krampus begins with his companion.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Saint Nicholas is said to have been a bishop of Myra, in what is now Turkey, in the fourth century.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Almost nothing about his life is known for certain.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But his legends spread across Europe.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In one of the best known, told in the thirteenth-century Golden Legend, Nicholas secretly throws gold into a poor man's house at night, so that his three daughters can marry.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "He does it three times.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Over time, the saint's feast day, December sixth, became linked with gifts for children.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-02",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "In some places, his visit also came with a question: had the children been good?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The giver of gifts had also become a judge.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And a judge, it seems, needed someone to carry out the sentence.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "When Nicholas's dark companions appear in historical accounts, they belong to these Christian customs: plays, and visits to homes.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Nicholas arrives with figures dressed as devils, in masks, furs, and bells.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In these Christian settings, the devil is brought under the saint's authority.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Even the frightening companion works for the saint.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The companions had many names.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In much of Germany, Knecht Ruprecht.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In parts of Tyrol and Carinthia, Klaubauf.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In Austria, Krampus.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The origin of that name is uncertain, though it is often linked to an old word for a hook or a claw.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The name, the costume, and the role changed from valley to valley.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "There was never just one Krampus.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The Krampus most people picture today owes a great deal to the postcard.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In 1869, Austria-Hungary introduced what is often called the world's first official postcard.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the decades that followed, many colorful cards for the Nicholas season were printed, and Krampus appeared on many of them.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "On these cards, Krampus took a familiar shape: dark fur, horns, a long red tongue, chains, a bundle of twigs, and sometimes children carried off on his back.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Some cards were meant to frighten.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Others turned him into a striking piece of design.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "These cards, from a Vienna workshop around 1910, are now kept in a city museum.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-01",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "So where does the idea of a pagan Krampus come from?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the nineteenth century, writers such as Jacob Grimm looked for traces of a pre-Christian past in later customs.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Grimm wrote that he could well imagine that even in heathen times, a god whose coming heralded a happy time had a merry elf or dwarf at his side.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "He was imagining, not quoting a record.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Masked winter processions, like the Perchten runs held around early January, seemed to fit such ideas.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And in some places, these customs had already mixed with the Nicholas custom by the eighteenth century.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It is possible that older winter customs shaped the masks and furs.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But no ancient text names Krampus, and the accounts we have place him inside the Christian Nicholas custom.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the twentieth century, some critics questioned the use of Krampus to frighten children.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Yet the custom lived on.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Today, Krampus runs draw large crowds in the Alps, and in recent decades he has found new audiences far beyond them.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-01",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "So, is Krampus older than Christmas?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The records tell a different story.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "He appears as a devil in the service of a saint, goes by many names in the Alps, and gets his famous face from printed cards.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "His roots may run deeper.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But as far as the sources can show, his story begins with a bishop who brought gifts.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Every story has an origin.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sometimes, it begins with a knock at the door on a winter night.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-01",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "This video is based on historical texts and public museum collections.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-02",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "The narration uses synthetic speech.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-03",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sources and terms of use are listed in the description.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-04",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "If you enjoyed this story, please like the video and subscribe for more quiet origins.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-05",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Thank you for watching.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  }
]
